<human_speech><blue>Three seats and no allies. The drillmaster and the reader are both hostile to you. To each other, too.<\blue><green>The Cycler musters before it strikes. A muster leaves its subs thin. You know who is watching for that.<\green><blue>You do not have to win the fight. You have to be alive and second, and then first.<\blue><green>Do not be the largest fleet on the board until you must.<\green><\human_speech>
